---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support Us">
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-8">Support Us</h1>
      
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-6">Make a Donation</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Your contribution is essential to support our cultural promotion, environmental protection, and education activities. 
          Every donation, small or large, helps us carry out social utility projects.
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-[#C5A059]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-4">Bank Details</h3>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Beneficiary</dt>
              <dd class="text-[#1A2B4C] font-mono">Fondazione Benedettina Pax Et Sapientia Ets</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">IBAN</dt>
              <dd class="text-[#1A2B4C] font-mono">IT56W0306909606100000414622</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">BIC/SWIFT</dt>
              <dd class="text-[#1A2B4C] font-mono">BCITITMM</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Bank</dt>
              <dd class="text-[#1A2B4C]">Intesa Sanpaolo (Example)</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-4">Tax Benefits</h2>
        <p>
          As a Third Sector Entity (ETS), donations made to the Pax et Sapientia Foundation 
          enjoy the tax benefits provided by current legislation (D.Lgs. 117/2017). 
          Keep the transfer receipt for your tax return.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
